Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:40.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《速度与激情7》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 如果你想看到未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say if you wantto glimpse the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需看眼过去即可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:01:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前觉得那是瞎扯淡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think that was bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法逃离过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't outrun the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是孩子的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会去和最壮的家伙打架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd start fights with the toughest bastards in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但每次都是我介入帮你打赢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was the one who had to step in and finish them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去拐角的超市里偷东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd steal from the corner shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,挨打的却是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who'd brave the old man's belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能长大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hoped you'd outgrown it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望在黑帮里的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That playing the gangster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让你更坚强 更聪明 更强大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}made you harder, smarter, better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是内心深处 我知道你肯定是这个下场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But deep down, I guess I always knew you'd end up like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教你的那些毫无用处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}despite everything I did teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是我的亲人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're my flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我还是要对你负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you remain my cross to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息吧 弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest now, little brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把你最后的活干完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I settle your one last score.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们照顾好我弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care of my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他出了什么事 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything happens to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会来找你们算账{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come by looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 唐 你要把我带到哪里去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dom. So where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说大路有助于人们思考{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say an open road helps you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,思考你从哪里来 要到哪里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about where you've been, where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你还是什么都不记得？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't remember any of this yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不记得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你到底想给我看什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it exactly that you're trying to show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,车赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Race Wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前经常来这里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「来这里」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Come here"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是创始人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We invented it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持发动机转速在每秒9000转以下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it under 9, 000 RPMs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小子的活塞马上就会爆掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid's gonna fry his pistons after the first 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这不是我的风格 要么赛车要么死 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that's not my style. I gotta ride or die, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就把这场比赛开好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you just ride on this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你是准备好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 干得不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常常听说你的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the girl I heard so much about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前跑哪里去了 神秘美女？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you been at, ghost girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘美女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂 这他妈怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧槽 厉害！这姑娘的勾拳还是那么厉害啊 老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, dawg! Girl's still got that swing, homie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直不禁打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never could take a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你回来了我真高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man. I'm glad you're back, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.40,0:08:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你太棒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴 赫克托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you, Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们到了 杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We made it, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶 我们到了！- 是啊 我们到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we made it! - Yeah, we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我找找那个开门的按钮在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I just gotta find that door button.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙 你知道开门的按钮在哪吗？你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, where's the door button at? Do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 我还不熟悉这车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course. I'm new to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你看上去就不像是开房车的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you don't seem like the minivan type.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不怎么像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小家伙 和我击个掌吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, you gonna give me a high five?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等！等等 击掌！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait! Wait, high five!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 就是这样 小家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Yeah, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 你马上就能习惯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. You'll get used to this in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我就怕这个呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次看到这个的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time I saw this,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还觉得这有点可笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was kind of funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想现在可笑的是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess now the joke's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就该这么做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I should've done a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天我失忆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the date that I lost my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天莱蒂就死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the date that Letty died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我出生了 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I was born. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道当你看着我 能回想15年的回忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how hard it is for me when you look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.16,0:10:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说有多难受吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you see me through 15 years of memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.52,0:10:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有过那些美好的回忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every beautiful moment we've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能在你的眼里看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给不了你什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't give that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你只有我的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've got only a piece of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:11:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找我自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to find myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很失望 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're disappointed, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次逮捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,太容易了 目标都没逃跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was too easy. Target didn't even run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正好有机会练练手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gives me a chance to hit the iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还能让我锻炼敲章的能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also lets me work on my stamping skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:11:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不擅长撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a terrible liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见 老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tomorrow, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天见 - 别待太久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll see you then. - Don't stay too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想待多久待多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay as long as I want, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you would say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.04,0:12:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莲娜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你要的推荐信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the letter of recommendation you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我写的都是我真心所想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just know I meant every word in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 霍布斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这气氛太伤感了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, way too sentimental right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get home. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不是IT部门的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure as hell ain't the IT guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你最好告诉我你是谁 要不然我就用六种不同的方法折断那根手指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you better start talking before I break that finger six different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后插在见不到太阳的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stick it right where the sun doesn't shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.56,0:13:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是霍布斯探员 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Hobbs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个世界上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm also the last man on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最不该黑的电脑就是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose computer you want to be hacking into.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你惹上大麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just earned yourself a dance with the devil, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被逮捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的电脑不关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来是想找那个让我弟弟瘸腿的小队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for the team that crippled my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么狗屁小队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't no goddamn team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有一个人 他就站在你面前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just one man, and he's standing right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个姑娘说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lady was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不擅长撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a terrible liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,操他妈的IT男{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn IT guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍布斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莲娜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍布斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍布斯！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小家伙 我们得走了 我们要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, buddy. We gotta go. We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你觉得怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个漂移去学校吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parking brake slide right up to the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 她在楼上 她马上就来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. She's up there. She's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:16:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 你有个包裹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, you have a package out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是东京寄来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？韩想要把我变成一个涡轮增压机？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Is Han trying to convert me over to a turbocharger?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 耶！- 嘿 小家伙 汽车可不会飞哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Hey, buddy. Cars don't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 车子不会飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, cars don't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个就会飞对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩开房车 真是今非昔比了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian in a minivan. Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很不习惯 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's struggling, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想让我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't want me to see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那个白色的围栏就像是他身上的锚 我看得出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the white picket fence is like an anchor on him. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我前几天晚上想和他谈谈这事 你知道他说了什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to talk to him the other night. You know what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想念那些女孩 他也不想那些车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't miss the girls, he doesn't miss the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想念的是子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He misses the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他习惯这一切 给他点时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him settle in. Give him time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,九个月怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does nine months sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.52,0:17:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又怀孕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having another baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没有告诉他 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't tell him, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要告诉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让他对自己的生活失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want him to be disappointed with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远不会对你失望的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will never be disappointed with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.84,0:18:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他遇到过的最好的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best thing that's ever happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.40,0:18:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,多米尼克·托莱多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不认识我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的锁骨碎裂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shattered his collarbone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,腿也骨折了两处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fractured his leg in two places.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今天早上才从昏迷状态醒转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He only regained consciousness this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开口第一句话就是「把唐给我找来」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first thing he said was, "Get me Dom."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.96,0:19:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在等我们 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's waiting. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,人给你带来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your files.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冒着生命危险保护这个自由世界 他们给你啥了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You risk life and limb to save the free world and what do they give you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,果冻 还有一部糟糕的七十年代电视剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jell-O and a bad '70s TV show.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实还是有一些好处的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's got its perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 海绵浴就很舒服 - 爸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sponge baths ain't that bad. - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,「爸」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我想让你见个人 他是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, I want to introduce you to somebody. He's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,去和他问好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on and say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是多米尼克·托莱多 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominic Toretto, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸说 有次他把你教训了一顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad said he kicked your ass once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姑娘 说话注意点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young lady, watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸吃了太多止痛药了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's on heavy pain meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的回忆可能已经不是很清晰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can understand if his history is a little hazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得不会 - 好了宝贝 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I doubt it. - All right, honey, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟伊莲娜去买点吃的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to go get something to eat with Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟托莱多谈谈 懂了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}while me and Toretto have a talk. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 小美女 我们去吃曲奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, lady. Let's get some cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吃太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch that mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁干的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得欧文·肖吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Owen Shaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个我们翻了大半个伦敦抓到的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one we tore half of London down trying to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回是他的大哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is his big bad brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这份文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,德卡特·肖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deckard Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国特种部队的杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}British Special Forces assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种任何政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind of unique asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不会承认的影子部队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that no government would ever admit to employing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:21:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝密行动部队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Ops boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.80,0:22:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟的是 他们培养出了个麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse. They created a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.32,0:22:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,起初觉得肖的那股狠劲是必须的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They felt Shaw was a necessary evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到最后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现他可有可无{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they decided he was unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的那种能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The powers that be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.44,0:22:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经超过了限度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}felt that he knew just a little bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙的后来帮了倒忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The asset became a liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面派了20个顶尖高手想除掉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they sent in 20 elite operatives to retire him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.84,0:22:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们失手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是六年前的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was six years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖之后一直毫无踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Shaw's been a ghost ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么才能找到他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,官方的回复 别去找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The official answer is, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了韩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还差点杀光我一家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost killed my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还差点把我整进尸体袋里呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also tried to put me in a body bag, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我出院了 我要狠狠打到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why when I get out, I'm gonna put a hurt on him so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,后悔老妈把自己生出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna wish his mama had kept her legs closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这之前 官方对你的要求是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until then, my official answer to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,静待其变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我做不到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you know I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂你 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do know you, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.76,0:22:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要跟你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why now I give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.04,0:22:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟间的真心话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the brother-to-brother answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.00,0:23:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该怎么做就这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do whatever it is you gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你找到那混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you find that sumbitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just do me one favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么忙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别失手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.24,0:23:14.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（多米尼亚共和国 蒙特克里斯蒂）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢你让我住在这里 芒多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much for letting us stay, Mando.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿这不会太麻烦你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 唐要想两天内安全偷渡进里约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Dom needed a safe delivered to Rio in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.08,0:23:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.16,0:23:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在多米尼亚照顾他的家人 简直跟度假一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hosting his family in the Dominican Republic, that is vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人要是敢在这里惹你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone messes with you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就惹了整个国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they mess with the entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是安全的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.76,0:23:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 他们到了 我亲自去机场接他们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, they're here. I picked them up myself at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 你哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.40,0:23:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 米娅 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Mia, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.64,0:23:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边情况怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.72,0:23:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在芒多家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at Mando's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方跟个堡垒一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is like a fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.64,0:23:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得看看布莱恩 他完全进入了联邦调查局模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see Brian. He's in full FBI mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.92,0:24:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,芒多的车库都被他改造成个监控站了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He built a surveillance hub in Mando's garage and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那边呢？找到是谁要对付我们了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? Did you find out who's after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.04,0:24:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来我们在伦敦造的孽找上门了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the sins of London have followed us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩什么反应？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did Buster take the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没告诉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.08,0:24:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他知道我又怀了 他肯定会留在我们身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he knew about the baby, he'd stay here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.16,0:24:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这种情况 你需要他在你身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with all that's going on, you're gonna need him by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.32,0:24:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好照顾他 保证他的安全就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watch out for him. Keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.40,0:24:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 一定要一起回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And come home together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.64,0:24:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉布莱恩 我两天后在洛杉矶跟他碰头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Brian I'll see him in LA in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.72,0:24:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.80,0:24:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得接韩回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bringing Han home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.08,0:24:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当局仍在调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities are still trying to determine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.24,0:24:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到36小时前 于洛杉矶市中心发生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the motive behind this daring attack here at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,针对美国外交安全局办公室的袭击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the US Diplomatic Security Service in downtown Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.48,0:24:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,背后的真正目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}less than 36 hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.32,0:24:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,消息还在不断更新{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Facts are still coming in,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.48,0:24:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但目前我们知道的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what is known is the suspect entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.72,0:24:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌犯当时处于大楼第四层…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the building's fourth floor…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.44,0:24:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.36,0:24:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙真是步步相逼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's just relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.32,0:24:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以唐才需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Dom needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.68,0:25:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩需要在他再次对我们的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two need to find this guy and you need to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.68,0:25:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,下手前 找到并阻止他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he does any more damage to our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.12,0:25:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.16,0:25:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经搞砸太多事情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've screwed up so many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.00,0:25:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次要再搞砸 我都受不了自己了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't live with myself if I screw this up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.64,0:25:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.96,0:25:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.96,0:25:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我们 这才是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in us. That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.32,0:25:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.00,0:25:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要保证 这次之后 我们就金盆洗手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just promise me, after this, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.68,0:25:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再接任务 不再有敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more jobs, no more enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.68,0:25:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到我们身边来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.48,0:25:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你失望的 米娅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you down, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.96,0:25:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.56,0:25:56.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（日本 东京）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.92,0:26:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 肖恩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yo, Sean!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.20,0:26:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 看看这个 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, check this out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.68,0:26:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有个家伙想跟新晋甩尾王赛一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dude over here want to race the new DK.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.92,0:26:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚算了 小闪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tonight, Twinkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.84,0:26:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说认识韩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he knew Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.60,0:26:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩说过你很快 但没说这么快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han said you was fast, but not that damn fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.52,0:26:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说美国肌肉男不会漂移了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said American muscle can't drift?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.40,0:26:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩总是说 他的敌人都被甩在他身后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han mentioned he left his enemies in his rearview.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.56,0:26:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事他从来不多说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never talked about it much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.72,0:26:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总不把心思说明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always playing it close to the vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.24,0:26:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在现场找回了些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found a couple things by the crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.08,0:26:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也没留下多少东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't much left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉赛尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gisele.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.44,0:27:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.40,0:27:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一样东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.76,0:27:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还找到这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.68,0:27:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定对他有什么特别的意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have meant something to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.56,0:27:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你找到杀韩的凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you find the guy that killed Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.12,0:27:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.24,0:27:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,语言已不足以形容{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words ain't even been invented yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说要纪念那些离我们远去的人 最好的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say to live in the hearts of those we leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.84,0:27:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是好好活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.08,0:28:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他让你落得如此下场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he put you in this grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.76,0:28:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也要他血债血偿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now I'll do the same to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.80,0:28:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再参加葬礼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do no more funerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.92,0:28:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是韩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.84,0:28:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在霍布斯也进医院了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Hobbs is laid up, of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.00,0:28:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都成了猎物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're being hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.96,0:28:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道那家伙肯定在某个角落看着我们 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he's out there somewhere watching, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.16,0:28:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就代表他不会走远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means he's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.72,0:28:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 你要发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just promise me, Brian,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.36,0:28:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再有葬礼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no more funerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.36,0:28:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就最后一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.04,0:31:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该招惹我的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never should have messed with a man's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.36,0:31:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么跟你弟弟说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told your brother the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.88,0:31:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还加固了你的底盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reinforced your chassis.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们是要来场负重赛了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like going into a ring with weighted gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.60,0:31:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.48,0:31:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来小打小闹的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to play games.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.84,0:31:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们俩是不同世界的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you and me, we're from different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.20,0:32:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我见过很多比你更难缠的对手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I've seen a lot meaner streets than the ones you're used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.56,0:32:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那多呆一会儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.40,0:32:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情会越来越难缠的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna get a lot meaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.68,0:32:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我要跟你打一架吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought this was gonna be a street fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.84,0:32:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.84,0:32:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上趴下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.16,0:32:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他 不然我开枪了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop him or I will drop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.04,0:32:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 哇哦 悠着点 伙计们 我们是一伙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa. Easy, guys. We're on the same team here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.28,0:32:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,托莱多先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Toretto,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.68,0:32:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们共同的伙伴推荐我来这地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here on the recommendation of a mutual friend of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.72,0:32:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍布斯先生 - 你他妈谁啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Hobbs. - Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.56,0:32:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？我就是个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I'm just a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.36,0:32:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我谁都不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mr. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.84,0:32:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小人物的话 这入场也太华丽了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a big entrance for a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.36,0:32:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个害我们朋友进医院的家伙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the guy that put our mutual friend in the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.04,0:33:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚放跑他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.40,0:33:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我刚刚是救了你一命 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might have just saved your ass there, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.96,0:33:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 你能放开我的手下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you think you could let go of my guy there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.28,0:33:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他面色都有点发青了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's beginning to turn a little blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.92,0:33:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感谢你能这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.48,0:33:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,搅局的来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.08,0:33:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.32,0:33:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这种秘密人物之间有场战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a war going on between shadows and ghosts like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.60,0:33:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的团队在伦敦不知情地闯了进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your team unwittingly walked into the middle of it in London,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子战火都烧到你家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it appears it's now followed you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.76,0:33:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己决定吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.00,0:33:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先去喝一杯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.76,0:33:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你加入我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome to join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.24,0:33:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便一提 我可以找到德卡特·肖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I can get you Deckard Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.24,0:33:49.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加州埃尔塞贡多 机密行动基地）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.88,0:33:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利时艾尔啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belgian ale.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.12,0:33:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这群敲钟的做得太赞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, those monks got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.76,0:34:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确不明白那什么独身主义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't know about the whole celibacy thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.76,0:34:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说到啤酒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when it comes to beer…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.68,0:34:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来一杯吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.48,0:34:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟喜欢喝科罗娜牌子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more of a Corona man myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.96,0:34:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的档案不止详尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your file's not only detailed,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.96,0:34:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还很有意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's, uh, extremely entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.00,0:34:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 肖的能力就是隐于无形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Shaw's power is that he's a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.28,0:34:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最拿手来无影去无踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's really good at getting in and out of places without being seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.44,0:34:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了目标尸体 不留一丝痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leaving nothing but a body count in his wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.60,0:34:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他算是真正意义上的英国坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's a legitimate English badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.28,0:34:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说老实话 唐 我根本不在乎德卡特·肖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to be honest with you, Dom, I don't give two shits about Deckard Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.96,0:34:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.40,0:34:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你跟我互相帮助 最终就能各取所需{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you and I can help each other get what we both need.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.76,0:34:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.16,0:34:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近一个通缉恐怖分子摩西·杰卡帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just recently a private military company.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.80,0:34:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导的私人武装组织绑架了一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}led by a wanted terrorist named Mose Jakande.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.76,0:34:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,名叫拉姆齐的黑客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}kidnapped a hacker known only by the name "Ramsey."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.36,0:35:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国这边对他很感兴趣 也应该如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Lady Liberty's got her panties in a bunch over this, but rightfully so,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.32,0:35:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为拉姆齐发明了个有趣的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because this Ramsey has created something interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.64,0:35:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放到大屏幕上 - 是 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bring it up. - Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.44,0:35:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你呈现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.16,0:35:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to God's Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.64,0:35:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小家伙可以黑入任何电子设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this little bastard hacks into anything that's on the digital network.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括手机 卫星 自动取款机和电脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means every cell phone, satellite, ATM machine and computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.40,0:35:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是同时完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.52,0:35:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要设备带有话筒或者镜头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's got a microphone or a lens,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.40,0:35:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼就能找到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's Eye can find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.20,0:35:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我来就是让我看个跟踪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you invited me here to show me a tracking device.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.72,0:35:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,变态级的 而且数量众多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On steroids. Lots of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.84,0:35:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这么说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me put it to you this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.56,0:35:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们花费了数年之久才找到奥萨马·本·拉登{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took us nearly a decade to find Osama bin Laden.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.20,0:35:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这软件 不管他在地球上什么位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this, we'd have located him anywhere on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.04,0:35:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几小时就能找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.28,0:35:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一件如果落在坏人手里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's a serious piece of machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.88,0:35:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会是一场大灾难的设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could be catastrophic in the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.16,0:35:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但由于某些可恶的政治原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for some very nauseating political reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.36,0:35:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何与美国政府势力或武装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any rescue plans involving.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.72,0:35:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,相关的营救计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any US government forces or entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.68,0:35:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不能执行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been strictly ruled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.08,0:35:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我需要你的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.36,0:35:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我为什么需要你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why do I need you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.80,0:35:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 我可以出了这地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I could go back outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.96,0:35:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,享用剩下的科罗娜啤酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}enjoy the rest of the Coronas,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.32,0:35:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等肖来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}let Shaw come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.20,0:36:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以这么做 但到目前为止结果怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could do that. How's that working out for you so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.00,0:36:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的一个朋友死了 另一个在医院躺着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got one friend in the ground, another one in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.36,0:36:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 还有炸弹炸毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, of course, there's that little issue of the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.76,0:36:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你房子的小问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that destroyed your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.24,0:36:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖所生活的世界 规矩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shaw lives in a world that doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.96,0:36:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}play by your rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.68,0:36:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你愿不愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.84,0:36:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在也在那个世界中了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you live in that world now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.20,0:36:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道怎么杀死一个影子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know how to kill a shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.36,0:36:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要给他打一点光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just shine a little light on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.72,0:36:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你帮我拿到天眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get the God's Eye for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.40,0:36:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经得到授权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already got authorization.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.12,0:36:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给你使用 直到找到肖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to use it until you get Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.40,0:36:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从猎物变成了猎人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go from the hunted to the hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.44,0:36:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上不会有任何地方可以让肖躲过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no place on Earth Shaw can hide from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.08,0:36:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.84,0:36:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的家人不用再去参加任何葬礼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and your family don't go to any more funerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.76,0:36:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了拉姆齐 就找到了天眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get Ramsey, you get the God's Eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.44,0:36:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就找到了肖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.04,0:36:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我的球已经投出了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the wind-up and the pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了你如此敏感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that I've given you this incredibly sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,且高度机密的消息 你怎么想 托莱多？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and highly classified information, what do you think, Toretto?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.60,0:36:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你已经知道我会怎么做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you already know what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.80,0:37:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.20,0:37:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但得用我的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it'll be my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.88,0:37:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜到你会这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assumed you might say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.28,0:37:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也就是我召集了你队伍的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I've taken the liberty of gathering your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.32,0:37:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.48,0:37:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿是要干什么呀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.28,0:37:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的智囊团认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our intelligence suggests that Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.24,0:37:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐会被武装车队转移{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be transported by an armed motorcade.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.12,0:37:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过高加索山脉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the Caucasus mountain range.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.96,0:37:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们通过山脉到达目的地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they clear this range and reach their destination,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.16,0:37:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再也别想找到她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey is as good as gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.96,0:37:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我说得直接点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.16,0:37:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一条路可以进出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one road that leads in or out,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.80,0:37:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,周边都是悬崖峭壁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sheer drops on every side,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.92,0:37:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这该死的车队周围任何方向一公里范围内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a motorcade from hell protected by a small army.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.64,0:37:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有军队严密保护？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from one mile in either direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.80,0:37:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.64,0:37:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说完了？- 不 没说完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You done? - No, I'm not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.64,0:37:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们希望我闯入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you all wanted me to break into.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.28,0:37:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一所警察局 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a police station. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.44,0:38:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着你们又让我阻止一辆坦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you asked me to stop a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.16,0:38:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是太高兴 但我还是做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't happy about it, but I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.16,0:38:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着你们想出这绝妙的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you came up with this brilliant idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.24,0:38:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,打下一架史上最大的飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to shoot down one of the largest airplanes ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.76,0:38:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把那该死的玩意儿轰出了天空 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot that shit out of the sky. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.84,0:38:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.84,0:38:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个 我的朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this right here, my friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.36,0:38:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}happens to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.64,0:38:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子听到的最愚蠢的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the stupidest idea I've ever heard of in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.08,0:38:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了原来飞机是你一个人打下来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot that you were the only one to bring the plane down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.32,0:38:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我唯一看到他打下的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. The only thing I've ever seen him take down was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.48,0:38:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没膝盖的丹尼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No Knees" Denise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.72,0:38:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？舞会那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, at prom?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.60,0:38:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 布莱恩？你要在这里这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Brian? You're gonna do that right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.84,0:38:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧 你们所有人就想打乱我的思路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, y'all trying to get me off my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.36,0:38:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是 我厌倦了让我身边的所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying is, I'm tired of everybody around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.56,0:38:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定所有的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}making all the decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.72,0:38:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次 我来领队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, I lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.28,0:38:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,严肃点 如果不能让我做决定的话 我退出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously. If I don't start making decisions, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.60,0:38:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.96,0:38:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么想法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.88,0:38:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想立即立刻全面领导什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I wasn't trying to get into the whole leadership thing, like, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.04,0:38:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂我的意思吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.48,0:38:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想说总有个时刻得让我拍板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just, kind of, talking about, like, at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.68,0:38:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 你知道的 当我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, you know, when we…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.04,0:38:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我是说 我想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. I mean, I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.68,0:39:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从这里攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hit it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.88,0:39:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不认为那里… - 别 别 别 别思考{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think that that's… - No, no, no, don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.20,0:39:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.52,0:39:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里攻击是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is impossible to hit it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.56,0:39:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里堪称是山上最安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is literally the most secure spot on the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.88,0:39:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？因为你根本到不了这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because you cannot physically access it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧 这就是这里的优势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's what makes it so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.72,0:39:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是他们最不会防备我们攻击的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's the place that they least expect us to hit them from.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.40,0:39:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我不想承认 他似乎说到了点子上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as I hate to admit it, he's onto something there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.48,0:39:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 唐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.88,0:39:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.24,0:39:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们有计划了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.56,0:39:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全错误的想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Completely wrong thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.40,0:39:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.08,0:39:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧？我很擅长做这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? I'm good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.76,0:39:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「擅长」？好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Good"? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.52,0:39:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么计划到达那条路上呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you planning on getting on that road?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.48,0:39:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 特吉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Tej?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.48,0:39:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于这点 我可能真的有计划了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I may actually have a plan for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.44,0:40:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？我分工了 一个好的领导就要这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I delegated. That's what good leaders do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.28,0:40:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.60,0:40:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看你的档案时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I was reading your files,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.64,0:40:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的队伍做到的事情给我很深的印象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was impressed with what you've accomplished with your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在见到了他们 我必须说 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But meeting them now, I've gotta say, Dom,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.28,0:40:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的有一种天赋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've truly got a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.00,0:40:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的车间当成你新的玩具厂吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider my workshop your new playhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.68,0:40:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会发现我们的车非常吸引人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll find our cars extremely appealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.44,0:40:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的队伍现在齐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your team is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.52,0:40:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.16,0:40:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到处找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for you everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the shit out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.92,0:40:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会再一个人了 不管你去哪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never be alone. Wherever you go…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.08,0:40:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要告诉别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.48,0:40:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里找到的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在韩的车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found in Han's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.12,0:41:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人当成留言故意留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was left as a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.72,0:41:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算好好「回报」他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A message I plan on returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.80,0:41:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以开车吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.16,0:41:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.88,0:41:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩也是我的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han was my family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.16,0:41:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.64,0:41:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,每辆车上都要装越野避震器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need long-travel suspension,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.88,0:41:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有限滑差速器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}limited-slip differentials on all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.04,0:41:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.88,0:41:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,特吉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.04,0:41:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你把这辆车的优点和那辆的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the demon love child between that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.36,0:41:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,结合起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.92,0:41:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有很多的防护钢板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.44,0:41:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,会增加车体重量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just gonna add more weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.08,0:41:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,减慢速度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.36,0:41:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次要的不仅仅是速度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, it ain't just about being fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.08,0:41:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我很厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.88,0:41:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初混大街的时候 你知道我在说什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the streets. You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.56,0:41:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.56,0:42:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 罗曼 你吓死了对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Roman, you're freaking out, ain't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.04,0:42:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 有的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.80,0:42:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.36,0:42:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计 一个成熟的人能接受自己的感受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, man, it takes a grown man to embrace his feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.88,0:42:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想哭 就哭出来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you need to cry, just go ahead and cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.92,0:42:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为你的朋友 你知道我很关心你的健康{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your friend, you know I'm concerned about your well-being,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.76,0:42:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我提前做了预防{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why I took the precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.24,0:42:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了成人尿不湿在你的副驾抽屉里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of putting some adult diapers in your glove compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.08,0:42:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以闭嘴吗 伙计？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, can you just chill out, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.96,0:42:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过许多疯狂的事 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen some crazy shit, Dom,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.92,0:42:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个真的算是高潮了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this really could make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.76,0:42:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们尽可能的保持低调 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's just try to keep it as low-key as possible, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.48,0:42:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是一直如此吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't I always?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.72,0:42:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 你这次要能搞定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what, you knock it down a couple of notches this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.40,0:42:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把我的比利时啤酒换成一桶科罗娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll swap out my Belgian for a keg of Corona.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.92,0:42:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是给自己做了件好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be doing yourself a favor, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.64,0:42:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人可以跟我说说我们要干什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can somebody just walk me through what we're supposed to be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.96,0:42:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 罗曼 这是你的计划 你要接受它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Rom, this is your plan. You gotta embrace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.48,0:42:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是我的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this was not my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.84,0:42:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始了 游戏时间到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, here we go. Game time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.92,0:43:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 你不是需要新鲜空气吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, you need some fresh air?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.72,0:43:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为马上你就能吸到很多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're about to get a whole lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.08,0:43:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 出发！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.64,0:43:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你以为不能更好的时候对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when you didn't think it could get any better, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.36,0:43:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.48,0:43:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇呜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.40,0:44:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就顺畅了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.68,0:44:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都好吗？大家都出来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody good? Everybody make it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.56,0:44:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是没有告诉他们你干不了这个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just didn't tell them that this is not for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.84,0:44:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的任务！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not your mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.20,0:44:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼？怎么了 伙计？和我说话 快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rom? Hey, what's up, man? Talk to me, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.40,0:44:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做不到 - 去你妹的做不到！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't do it. - The hell you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.36,0:44:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计！你把那东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man! You throw that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.92,0:44:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,切到倒车档 赶紧给我出来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in reverse and get your ass out here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.68,0:44:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我做不到 好吗？听听我在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can't do it, okay? Listen to what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.04,0:44:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是时候！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now isn't the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.20,0:44:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和飞行员一起待在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'ma stay up here with the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.88,0:44:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在附近一带盘旋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna circle around and make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.56,0:44:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保你们在下面没事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we holding it down from up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.00,0:44:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快没时间了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.44,0:44:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落伞是用GPS导航的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chute is guided by GPS!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.08,0:44:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不用做！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.88,0:44:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特吉！- 我来解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tej! - I'm already on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.08,0:44:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.56,0:44:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉让你们失望了 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to let y'all down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.12,0:44:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就待在这里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'ma go ahead and stay up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.60,0:44:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.68,0:44:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉要让你失望了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry to let you down. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.08,0:44:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思 你要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you're…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.60,0:44:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,特吉！你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.44,0:45:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.72,0:45:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,特吉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.40,0:45:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你 特吉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you, Tej!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.24,0:45:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.48,0:45:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就要着陆了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground's coming fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.60,0:45:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 宝贝 加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.20,0:46:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爽！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.16,0:46:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,触底得分！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touchdown, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.00,0:46:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,车辆检查 汇报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car check. Call it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.40,0:46:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正常 - 正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.48,0:46:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 我们动手吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.32,0:46:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？求你们了 来个人把我弄出去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Please, man. Get me out of here, somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.24,0:46:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！那些树！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! The trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.16,0:46:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.20,0:46:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好了 罗曼 我们会回来找你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight, Roman. We'll come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.84,0:46:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划不是这样的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.12,0:47:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你只有一次救人的机会 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you got one chance to hit them here, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.12,0:47:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,失手的话 他们就会回到秘密基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss, they'll make it to their black site.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.84,0:47:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后从拉姆齐嘴里撬出他们需要的一切情报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they'll squeeze whatever information they need out of Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.20,0:47:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也没机会拿到装置 也没机会抓到肖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device and your chance of ever getting Shaw will be gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.20,0:47:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.08,0:47:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们汇合点见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you at the pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.44,0:47:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐应该在客车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey will be in the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.76,0:47:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就开工吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.32,0:47:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 有人来了 有四辆车在接近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, we have company. Four cars, inbound.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.72,0:47:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.80,0:47:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特吉 掩护！- 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tej, shield! - I'm on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.08,0:48:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 排队形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.00,0:48:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,防弹的 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bulletproof, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.36,0:48:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打不穿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't touch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.12,0:48:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞上去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.76,0:48:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好！哈哈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike! Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.48,0:48:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动机枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns free.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.68,0:49:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.60,0:49:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快躲开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.64,0:49:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些不是枪 那些根本就是机关炮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those aren't guns, those are goddamn cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.80,0:49:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是装甲弹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armor-piercing rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.44,0:49:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射抓钩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hook them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.16,0:49:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 特吉 引爆炸弹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, Tej, blow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.84,0:50:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯掉它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.60,0:50:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 该你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.04,0:50:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再近一点 特吉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little closer, Tej!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.52,0:51:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.72,0:51:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点！退后！别碰我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from me! Stay back! Don't you touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.32,0:51:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布莱恩 我会把你救出去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Brian. I'm gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.84,0:51:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但请你冷静 好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm gonna need you to settle down, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.44,0:51:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来把绑你的带子切开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna cut those things off of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.36,0:51:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.72,0:51:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 有一辆不明车辆靠近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we have an unidentified vehicle approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.80,0:51:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！再近点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.20,0:51:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须跳上去 - 不！不！不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna have to jump. - No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.72,0:51:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了！快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.80,0:51:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要离开这里 - 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta get out of here. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.60,0:51:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我！看着我！- 我不跳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at me! Look at me! - I'm not jumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.24,0:51:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不跳的话 我们都得死 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't jump, we're gonna die. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.76,0:52:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须跳 来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're jumping. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.88,0:52:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.20,0:52:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,二！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.88,0:52:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.60,0:52:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.48,0:52:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入 肖先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the party, Mr. Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.24,0:53:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂 你跟着布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, stay with Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.32,0:53:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.68,0:54:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？这也太疯狂了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.80,0:54:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你活命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.24,0:54:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有悬崖 悬崖！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a cliff. Cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.84,0:54:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,悬崖！那里有悬崖！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cliff! There's a cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.88,0:55:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.80,0:56:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太慢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.96,0:57:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.24,0:57:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了 贱人们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back, bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.48,0:58:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.40,0:58:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.32,0:59:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗曼 去找其他人 - 你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roman, get back to the others. - What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.24,0:59:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.88,1:00:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不说 你让我印象深刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say, I am impressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.32,1:00:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想知道是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would very much like to know the name of the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.68,1:00:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我制造了这么多麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is causing me so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.32,1:00:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里没路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.64,1:00:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.88,1:00:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就像被困在车灯前的鹿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's frozen like a damn deer in headlights.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.84,1:00:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,托莱多才不是鹿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toretto ain't no deer.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.92,1:00:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 多米尼克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.68,1:00:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出那个女孩 就给你活路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the girl, and I'll let you live.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.24,1:00:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.92,1:00:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回你也许要戴上头盔了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna put on your helmet for this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.44,1:00:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,头…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helm…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.72,1:00:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准司机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target the driver.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.08,1:00:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！他在想什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! What is he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.36,1:00:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.76,1:01:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的方向错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pointing the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.00,1:01:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I now?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.52,1:01:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的命令开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire on my mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.72,1:01:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有意思 - 三！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Interesting. - Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.84,1:01:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二！- 抓紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two! - Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.88,1:01:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.20,1:01:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.32,1:02:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来我们的恶魔混血儿成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like our demon love child worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.60,1:02:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也算是下山的路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one way down a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.20,1:02:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Ramsey?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.48,1:02:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猫咪醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello Kitty is awake.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.44,1:02:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她看起来不像是黑客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She don't look like a hacker to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.56,1:02:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你觉得黑客长什么样子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? And what do hackers look like?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.08,1:02:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不应该长那样 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't supposed to look like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.48,1:02:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说说 你知道他们通常戴着小小的歪歪扭扭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, like, you know how they normally wear them little,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.48,1:03:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇奇怪怪的眼镜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}weird glasses that's all crooked,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.52,1:03:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有喝苏打水长出来满脸的小脓包？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pimples all over their face from drinking soda?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.24,1:03:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 相信我 有那样的身材{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, trust me, with a body like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.16,1:03:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不会甘心蹲在电脑后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ain't gonna park it behind a computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.20,1:03:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.52,1:03:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞到头了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hit your head?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.72,1:03:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉恶心吗？耳鸣？没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling nauseous? Ears ringing? No?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.72,1:03:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的鞋呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my shoe?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.52,1:03:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坠地时飞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it flew off when you crashed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.56,1:03:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你开始感觉到刚才的那些症状 告诉我 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you start experiencing any of those things, let me know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.88,1:03:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道是该谢谢你们救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know whether to thank you for rescuing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.40,1:03:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是应该因为你们把我扔下悬崖而揍你们一顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or kick your ass for throwing me off a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.40,1:03:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,表示感谢还是揍一顿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank us or kick our ass, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.60,1:03:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不你告诉我们装置在哪里吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you tell us where that device is?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.80,1:03:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我寄给一个朋友了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mailed it to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.00,1:03:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在阿布扎比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Abu Dhabi.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.80,1:03:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很容易嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.08,1:03:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前那队人本来会为了这个折磨你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That other team would have tortured you for that information.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.48,1:03:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任他们 我相信你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't trust them. I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.52,1:03:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么相信我们？你都不认识我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why would you trust us? You barely know us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.20,1:03:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道得足够多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.60,1:04:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,前任警察 或者军人等类似的职业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ex-cop. Military, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.00,1:04:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你对付他们的手法能看得出接受过训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you took out them guys shows training.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.16,1:04:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,技术男 别人对黑客的评论自然也冒犯了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tech guy, offended by the hacker remark, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.72,1:04:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.96,1:04:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大嫂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.16,1:04:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,逗乐的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joker.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.64,1:04:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.44,1:04:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是大哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double alpha.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.36,1:04:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,美男子 知道什么意思吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man candy. You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.60,1:04:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你他妈给我坐下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, sit your candy ass down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.32,1:04:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disrespect is real around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.04,1:04:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活是二次元 不是零就是一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is binary. Zeroes and ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.00,1:04:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有两样东西能让这样的团队聚在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only two things keep a group like this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.24,1:04:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕或忠诚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear or loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.40,1:04:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们当中我没看到一丝害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't see a drop of fear among you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.12,1:04:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常精彩 但有一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very impressive. Just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.88,1:04:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not married.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.92,1:04:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她错得太离谱了 这也不对吧 你就这样放任吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's so off, it's crazy. You just gonna roll with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.48,1:04:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说一队里不能有两个老大吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me there can't be a double alpha in one group?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.00,1:04:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为美国政府工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work for US government?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.52,1:04:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有共同利益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got similar interests.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.88,1:04:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,特吉 打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej, call it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.16,1:05:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去中东了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to the Middle East!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.60,1:05:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.28,1:05:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 唐 在山上可真够狂野的 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dom. It was pretty wild on that mountain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.04,1:05:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那太悬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was too close.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.44,1:05:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们完成了任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we got the job done.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.00,1:05:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道疯狂的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the crazy thing is, is…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.56,1:05:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怀念子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.48,1:05:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 一团糟 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's messed up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.56,1:05:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 我见过你跳下火车 从飞机上跳海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, I've seen you jump from trains, dive from planes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.60,1:05:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我见你的那天就看出了你的勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I saw your courage the day I met you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.00,1:05:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.92,1:05:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我见你做过的最勇敢的事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to know the bravest thing I ever saw you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.92,1:05:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,做米娅的好丈夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a good man to Mia.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.24,1:05:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我侄子杰克的好父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a great father to my nephew, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.20,1:06:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在寻找刺激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's looking for the thrill,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.00,1:06:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但唯一真实的是家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what's real is family.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.68,1:06:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.60,1:06:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住这一点 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to that, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.00,1:06:43.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿拉伯联合酋长国 阿布扎比）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.00,1:07:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想象的要热多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hotter than I thought it would be.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.80,1:07:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们在沙漠 当然热了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we are in the desert, so it would be hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.84,1:07:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我说的不是天气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I ain't talking about the weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.28,1:07:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 天啊 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My, my, my. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.00,1:07:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that is a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.60,1:07:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得你从飞机上跳下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's worth falling out a plane for.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.08,1:07:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边去 伙计 我先下了饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there, man, I got dibs on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.80,1:07:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我在看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen me looking at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.88,1:07:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说「下饵」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just say "dibs"?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.64,1:07:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多大啦 四年级吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, in the fourth grade?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.84,1:07:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你能走开吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, can you just get out of there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.48,1:07:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说得自由竞争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's a free market.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.68,1:07:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢？走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.20,1:07:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们剪刀 石头 布 赢的人约她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock, paper, scissors for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.68,1:07:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是玩真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys for real right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.84,1:07:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.56,1:07:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看上去都被俘获了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both look whupped already.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.04,1:08:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼神都和跟踪狂一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got stalker eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.56,1:08:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年前 我试着钓拉姆齐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to call dibs on Ramsey two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.04,1:08:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的膝盖对我的蛋蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her knee, my balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.60,1:08:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 你们不会想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, you don't wanna do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.72,1:08:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！拉姆齐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Ramsey!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.52,1:08:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 沙法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Safar.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.32,1:08:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你交了新朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you make some new friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.92,1:08:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 一些毛躁的新朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, some short-tempered new friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.00,1:08:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要之前寄给你的快速驱动盘 它在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the speed drive I sent you. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.76,1:08:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你要是知道我把它卖了 一定很高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good. You will be pleased to know I sold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.60,1:08:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它卖了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.96,1:08:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.24,1:08:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你好好保管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you to take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.64,1:08:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要卖了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why on earth would you sell it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.56,1:08:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要拿回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.76,1:08:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.96,1:08:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙法 我在里面藏了些东西 这很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safar, I stashed something inside it. It's important.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.28,1:08:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.92,1:08:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是 它很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, good news. It is safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.92,1:08:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the bad news?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.92,1:08:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全过头了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is very safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.08,1:08:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它卖给了一个住在那上面的约旦王子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sold it to a Jordanian prince living up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.20,1:08:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,亿万信托基金的富家子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust fund billionaire.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.60,1:08:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说想把它用在他的超级跑车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he wanted to use it for his supercar.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.68,1:08:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, see, this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.80,1:08:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, I like.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.52,1:08:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亿万富翁 超级跑车…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billionaire, supercar…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.00,1:09:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那车有什么过人之处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes it so super?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.84,1:09:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高时速两百四十二英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}242 miles per hour, top speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.96,1:09:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还防弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's bulletproof.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.52,1:09:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,两百四十二…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}242…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.60,1:09:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有我一个人亢奋了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only one aroused right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.96,1:09:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像 你知道我什么意思吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, like, you know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.64,1:09:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.68,1:09:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他车放哪里了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does he keep it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.12,1:09:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的顶层公寓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his penthouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.36,1:09:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tower number one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.88,1:09:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他要把车停在顶楼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why in the hell would he keep his car in his penthouse?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.28,1:09:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是亿万富翁 朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a billionaire, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.52,1:09:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱干嘛就干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.88,1:09:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天刚好是一年中白昼最长的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tomorrow happens to be the longest day of the year.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.68,1:09:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子要在下午开个派对庆祝一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prince wants to celebrate it and host a party tomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.84,1:09:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我们混进去 没问题吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can get us up there, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.24,1:09:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.04,1:09:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 呃 穿成这样可不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, not dressed like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.20,1:10:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.60,1:10:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿不对劲吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.12,1:10:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多烦心事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a billion things wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.36,1:10:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝不是此刻应该考虑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not in this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.44,1:10:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天很帅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look handsome.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.80,1:10:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都有点不好意思了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.76,1:10:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.44,1:10:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天的打扮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just seeing you dressed like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.36,1:10:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想起了一些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just reminds me of something.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.36,1:10:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.60,1:10:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old times.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.56,1:10:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.40,1:10:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.72,1:10:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏开场了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.60,1:11:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 听着 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Listen, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.16,1:11:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟我说他们每天都开派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're telling me they party like this every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.32,1:11:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个楼层 每天都这么嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this level, they party every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.16,1:11:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了 我应该搬到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy. I might have to move out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.32,1:11:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我要引领一个新潮流了 就叫做Blarab{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna start a new culture. It's called Blarab.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.44,1:11:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 听起来像「阿拉伯黑人」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like "black Arab."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.88,1:11:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,特吉 进展如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we looking, Tej?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.44,1:11:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.68,1:11:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 流程是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so this is how it works.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.64,1:11:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须得同时进去 才有可能的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to move in sync if we're gonna pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.76,1:11:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们顺一遍 确保{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's go over it to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.20,1:11:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都清楚自己的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone clearly understands their roles.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.36,1:11:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 说给你听的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, that means you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.08,1:11:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你现在越来越不专业了 特吉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, you're being real unprofessional right now, Tej.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.64,1:11:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼芯片藏在驱动盘里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The God's Eye chip is hidden in a speed drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.64,1:12:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱动盘在王子的车里 而车在保险库里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}installed in the prince's car, which he keeps in a safe room vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.60,1:12:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里大概有8到10个便衣保安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make 8 to 10 plainclothes security.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.60,1:12:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说还有王子本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention the prince.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.44,1:12:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的私人保镖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his personal bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.44,1:12:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄像头密布北墙 保险库就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security cameras are clustered by the north wall. That's where the vault is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.28,1:12:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得先进入保险库 然后黑进安全系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get in that vault, we got to tap into the security system,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.24,1:12:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能进入王子的卧室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which can be accessed in the prince's bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.04,1:12:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计们 我要进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.32,1:12:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.88,1:12:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我只是在找…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I was just looking for the…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.40,1:12:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 派对在那个方向 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The party is that way. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.08,1:12:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,此房间禁止入内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This room is off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.68,1:12:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 一旦我们进入了安全系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, once we're tapped in,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.72,1:12:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐和我就能黑进他们的网络把门打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey and I can hack into the network and pop the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.24,1:12:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们就能进去拿货了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can get in and get that shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.76,1:12:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 你漏掉我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. You missed a step.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.48,1:12:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了我吗？我应该做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my steps? What am I supposed to be doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.72,1:12:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 计划就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we didn't miss anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.32,1:12:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是一支特殊的队伍 所以当我们需要你的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're special teams. So when we need you,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.52,1:12:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你最擅长的事就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}do what you do best.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.88,1:12:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.80,1:12:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美展现罗曼·皮尔斯的魅力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shine brightly like only Roman Pearce can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.16,1:12:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.40,1:12:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没？我们也能愉快地对话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Now we talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.32,1:12:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 特吉 我进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Tej, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.80,1:12:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 找到电话接口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, find the phone jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.92,1:13:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接线一般都在那个后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tap always runs behind that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.36,1:13:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿会有一个350兆赫的超五类电缆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a 350-megahertz CAT5e cable.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.56,1:13:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,接口后面会有许多根线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They probably got a couple dozen back there,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.64,1:13:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要找到有充气外壳的那根{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this will be the bonded pair with the plenum coat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.84,1:13:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说人话 特吉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}English, Tej.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.08,1:13:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是橙色的那根{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be the orange wire.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.76,1:13:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 女士们先生们 我们已经进入安全系统了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, ladies and gentlemen, we are in the pilot seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.68,1:13:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Roman.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.36,1:13:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,展现你的魅力把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do whatever it is you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.16,1:13:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是你的生日 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your birthday, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.36,1:13:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是茉莉吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Jasmine?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.76,1:13:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 不 别来生日这套啊 - 把手给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God, no. Not the birthday routine. - Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.12,1:13:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你生日快乐 这边 过来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday to you. This way, this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.64,1:13:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 让一下 我得过去 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, so sorry. I'm coming through, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.80,1:13:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这边 各位 请给我一分钟的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way. Listen, excuse me one second.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.96,1:13:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 天啊 哥们 你不能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother, my brother. Man, you ain't supposed to…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.24,1:13:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.84,1:13:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 请听我说句话 朋友们 请过来这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, people. Please, everybody, gather around.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.12,1:13:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,理解一下 谢谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand something, right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.08,1:13:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来我要宣布一件事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to what I'm telling y'all.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.96,1:13:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是茉莉十八岁的生日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here to celebrate Jasmine's 18th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.12,1:13:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.52,1:14:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 祝你生日 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Happy birthday to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.96,1:14:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快乐 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.24,1:14:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快乐 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.80,1:14:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真是不忍直视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wish I didn't see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.16,1:14:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 帮我们开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, open it up for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.84,1:14:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 可以进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. You're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.16,1:14:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想象吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you realize what this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.52,1:14:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lykan HyperSport超跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lykan HyperSport.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.24,1:14:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百四十万美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}$3.4 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.52,1:14:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,3秒之内提速到60迈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero-to-60 in less than three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.68,1:14:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球限量7台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's seven of these things in the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.36,1:14:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这个王子却把它锁在了保险库里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this guy keeps it locked up in a vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.96,1:14:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再没有什么比困兽更可悲的事情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's sadder than locking a beast in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.44,1:14:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我真想给他一拳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I really want to punch him in the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.68,1:14:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.88,1:14:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始工作吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.84,1:15:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能撑得住吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.88,1:15:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.88,1:15:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我说他只是被魅力迷倒的 你会相信吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you believe I knocked him out with my charm?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.40,1:15:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可没有那个魅力 臭婊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't that charming, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.40,1:15:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,特吉 你的小把戏不管用了 我们没法控制系统了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej, your magic trick is failing. We're losing systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.56,1:15:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.08,1:15:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.12,1:15:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,特吉 说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.44,1:15:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力 但是他们的安全系统把我们锁在外面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying, but their security system is locking us out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 请听我说 女士们先生们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.84,1:15:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 王子来了 这是你们的舞者吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there he is. These are your dancers?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.88,1:15:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是个派对 嗨起来 宝贝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a party, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.56,1:16:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们或许该去卫生间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of y'all probably went to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.64,1:16:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看是不是发胶都不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and noticed that all the hairspray was missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.80,1:16:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是她用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. She did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.40,1:16:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.44,1:16:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能来我们实在是太高兴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're so happy for you to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.16,1:16:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的裙底藏了不少杀伤性武器 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you got some missiles underneath that dress. No?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.16,1:16:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有… 你还真说了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did not just… Did you just say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.00,1:16:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！别把门关了！别把门关了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit! Not the gate! Not the gate!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.12,1:16:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.08,1:16:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经竭尽全力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're playing all the defense we can up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.56,1:16:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没用 你们动作快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're gonna lose. You gotta hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.56,1:16:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地你出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.56,1:16:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对简直无聊死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These parties bore me to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.16,1:17:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 你们得马上离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, get out of there right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.24,1:17:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子调来了军队来对付你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got an army heading your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.88,1:17:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 快出来！别搞了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, get out! Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.40,1:17:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,特吉 我们直接把车带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej, we're taking the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.44,1:18:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天生就这样 你知道我在说什么吗？一旦我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I do. You know what I'm saying? As far as I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.60,1:18:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man, what's…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.40,1:18:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.56,1:18:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂 说话 你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, talk to me. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.20,1:18:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我撑不住了 最后一扇门也要关闭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I can't hold it. I'm losing the final gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.96,1:18:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须马上撤离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.84,1:18:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲出去！别管他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tear out the dash! Go through it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.32,1:18:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 冷静点 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Now, just hold on, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.36,1:18:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候让野兽出笼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to unleash the beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.40,1:19:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.08,1:19:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我 我来保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.32,1:19:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.20,1:19:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 车可不会飞！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, cars don't fly!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.60,1:20:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,车不会飞！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cars don't fly!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.16,1:20:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.40,1:20:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刹车坏了！- 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No brakes! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.80,1:20:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刹车坏了！- 该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No brakes! - Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.80,1:20:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.40,1:20:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.40,1:21:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.68,1:21:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿到了！- 快下车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it! - Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.72,1:22:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想念子弹吗 布莱恩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still miss the bullets, Brian?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.28,1:22:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊！破坏王们回来了 - 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah! There they are. Disaster. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.96,1:23:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你们弄进了阿布扎比最高级的派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get you an invite to the most exclusive party in Abu Dhabi.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.20,1:23:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沙法… - 别废话 我不听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Safar… - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.32,1:23:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不仅偷了车 还开着在两栋楼之间飞来飞去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You steal the host's car, and you jump it between two buildings.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.88,1:23:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其实是三栋楼 - 噢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually, it was three buildings. - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.68,1:23:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还嫌委屈了 三栋很值得骄傲吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, insult. Three, honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.88,1:23:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.00,1:23:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.68,1:23:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.08,1:23:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,您对「低调」的理解还真是独特 托莱多先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've got an interesting interpretation there of "low-key, " Mr. Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.52,1:23:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 唐 我以为我们已经达成共识了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Dom, I thought we had an understanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.36,1:23:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你不得不改变下游戏规则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you have to play the hand you're dealt.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.84,1:23:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我更愿意做庄家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I prefer to be the dealer.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.04,1:23:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.24,1:23:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被人从自己的车库赶出去 真有你们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being kicked out of my own garage. This is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.56,1:23:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, may I?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.68,1:23:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.12,1:23:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.44,1:24:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,费了这么大劲 都只是为了这么一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that trouble for this little.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.72,1:24:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.28,1:24:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, Dom,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.00,1:24:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你实在是太厉害了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really did great work back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.32,1:24:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的所有手下都在待命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of my men are now standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.32,1:24:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全听你差遣了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and are fully at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.36,1:24:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your call.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.32,1:24:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.12,1:24:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动它 帮我找到肖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire it up and find me Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.52,1:24:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 太激动人心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn, this is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.16,1:24:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.24,1:24:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给我点时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.04,1:24:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it doing now?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.40,1:24:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜寻中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hunting.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.56,1:24:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑进阿提哈德塔保安系统的摄像头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hacking into the security cameras at Etihad Towers.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.84,1:24:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你最后一次看到肖的地方 我们从那儿入手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last place you saw Shaw, so that's where we'll start.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.36,1:25:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他 就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him, right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.04,1:25:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这些数字是干什么的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. What are these numbers right here for?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.84,1:25:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正在用生物技术识别肖的脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bio-mapping Shaw's face.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.96,1:25:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在这个半球的所有探头录像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll run it against every camera.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.08,1:25:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,和所有音频设备中搜索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every audio device in this hemisphere.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.64,1:25:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 他应该藏在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo. Looks like he's holed up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.80,1:25:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不二选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.88,1:25:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动化工厂 没有人 遍地都是藏身之处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Automated factory, no people, lots of places to hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.52,1:25:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永久性地改变了搜寻方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just changed the face of manhunts forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.52,1:25:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.44,1:25:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我能看下邮箱吗 很快的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I check my email real quick?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.44,1:25:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过两个小时就天亮了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn's up in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.88,1:25:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一亮我们就去干掉肖 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go take down Shaw then.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.52,1:25:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去准备吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.60,1:26:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得出发了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.92,1:26:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你和你的手下 还有我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you, your team, and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.40,1:26:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你说要等到天亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.56,1:26:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友们是赛车手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guys are racers,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.76,1:26:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界一流的赛车手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the best drivers in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.60,1:26:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不是杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they ain't killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.20,1:26:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说 他会那么说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you he'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.92,1:26:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太了解你了 唐 所以我要和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you too well, Dom, and I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.16,1:26:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 看起来我们要开个抓捕派对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like we got a nice little hunting party.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.80,1:26:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去抓那只影子吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go bag a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.32,1:26:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有十公里 兄弟们 准备出动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten klicks out, boys. Get ready to rock and roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.68,1:26:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了 打开武器保险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Weapons hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.40,1:27:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你准备好了吗？- 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready for this? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.56,1:27:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你的最后一餐吃得愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're enjoying your last meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.00,1:27:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么点人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.44,1:27:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只值你们派这些人来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all I warrant?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.04,1:27:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,才十几个人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dozen men?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.84,1:27:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你觉得这人数绰绰有余的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll find it's more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.00,1:28:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经做好去见造物主的准备了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to meet my maker.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.32,1:28:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.60,1:28:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想什么呢 托莱多？想要偷袭我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you expecting, Toretto? To catch me off guard?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.08,1:28:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,期待我站在这里 挥舞着白旗投降？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me standing here, waving a white flag?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.60,1:28:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道没听过一句话叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever heard the saying,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.12,1:28:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,“敌人的敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The enemy of my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.20,1:28:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的朋友？”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is my friend?"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.36,1:28:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.56,1:28:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got family.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.96,1:28:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可有很多朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got a lot of friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.52,1:28:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人阵型！谢帕德 跟着我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-two formation! Sheppard, peel one!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.04,1:30:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 别管它了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, leave it!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.28,1:30:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.28,1:30:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.48,1:31:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's Eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.40,1:31:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该不会真以为我什么防备都没做就冲进去了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't really think I was gonna walk in there naked, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.48,1:31:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤得很重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got hit bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.88,1:31:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 托莱多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.12,1:31:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不会照我说的去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you won't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.92,1:31:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢我接下来要说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna want to hear what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.72,1:31:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the truth is,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.20,1:31:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的应该{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really ought to.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.44,1:31:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝艾尔啤酒 真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}try that Belgian ale, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.04,1:31:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很特别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something special.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.24,1:32:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔啤酒 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belgian ale, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.12,1:32:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们必须送你去医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we gotta get you to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.28,1:32:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别送我去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.88,1:32:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随身带着保命的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I carry my own health insurance.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.48,1:32:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急医疗队早就在待命了 他们已经赶来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}SOCM medics on standby. They're already inbound.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.72,1:32:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边停吧 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.80,1:32:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 你一定要保护拉姆齐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, you gotta protect Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.88,1:32:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要她活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as she's alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.60,1:32:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就能把他们从天眼系统踢出来 他们也知道这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she can lock them out of God's Eye, and they know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.00,1:32:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着不抓到她 他们是绝对不会罢休的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means they're not gonna stop coming until they've got her.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.56,1:32:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那个时候 他们会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this time, when they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.36,1:32:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出自己所有的人手 不惜一切来抓她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're gonna come with everything they've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.40,1:32:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会丢下你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.64,1:32:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.16,1:32:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我要离开你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.44,1:32:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.00,1:33:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我们愿不愿意 战争都已经开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A war is coming to us, whether we like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.68,1:33:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要打这场仗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a war is coming,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.76,1:33:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一定要在我们最熟悉的道路上迎战他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna face them on the streets we know best.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.20,1:33:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我支持迎战 但这也太疯狂了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all for winging it, but this is crazy, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.28,1:33:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们背后有雇佣兵拿着武器要抓我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got mercenaries with some real heat on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.84,1:33:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是害怕或是怎么了 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I ain't scared or nothing, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.04,1:33:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大哥 我连把枪都没有！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I don't even have a gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.00,1:33:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.52,1:33:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拥有的可是一座城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a whole city.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.24,1:33:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拥有的优势可能比那更多 如果他们使用天眼系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we may have more than that. If they use God's Eye,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.76,1:33:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会监视城市里的所有摄像头来寻找我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll tap the cameras around town to find our location.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.40,1:33:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就意味着我们可以植入一个病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means we could plant a virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.88,1:33:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在他们使用的时候进入系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then break in when they access it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.56,1:33:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你说的是要黑进我的黑客设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're talking about hacking my hacking device.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.08,1:33:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.48,1:33:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但还是有一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but there's one problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.20,1:33:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号的强弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.56,1:34:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不进入我们两英里以内的距离我们是无法黑进去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't start a hack on them until they're within a two-mile range.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.32,1:34:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那离得太近了 - 岂止是近？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's really close. - Close?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.20,1:34:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是职业军人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are military.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.40,1:34:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们之间的距离小于两英里 我们早就死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're within two miles of us, we're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.92,1:34:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们都在想什么 但我可没打算今天就死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about y'all, but I didn't really plan on dying today.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.52,1:34:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要活着只有一个办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one way to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.36,1:34:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们利用拉姆齐戏耍他们 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We play keep-away with Ramsey. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.92,1:34:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们一直在移动 他们就打不到我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't hit us if we keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.40,1:34:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我去对付肖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll take Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.52,1:34:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 总的来说 就是我们全副武装 然后玩烫手山芋的游戏 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, basically, we're just gearing up for a big game of hot potato, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.40,1:34:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪辆车是烫手山芋？- 妹子 你才是烫手山芋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which car is the potato? - Girl, you're the potato.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.12,1:34:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我觉得我可能再也见不到你了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it feel like I'm not gonna see you again?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.16,1:34:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来取这个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come back for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.28,1:34:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.88,1:34:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.88,1:35:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布莱恩 你没事吧？- 米娅 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brian, are you okay? - Mia, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.04,1:35:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事要发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's about to go down.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.96,1:35:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没有在24小时之内再联系你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you don't hear from me in 24 hours,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.80,1:35:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就要带着杰克继续生活了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to take Jack and move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.76,1:35:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听懂了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.52,1:35:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我意思了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.80,1:35:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我做不到 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't do that, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.92,1:35:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我做不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.88,1:35:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要有第二个孩子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have another baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.68,1:35:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.96,1:35:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要她的爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's going to need her father.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.40,1:35:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要做的就是完成手头的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have to finish what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.68,1:35:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后回到她的身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have to come home to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.76,1:35:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要回到我们身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to come home to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.92,1:35:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我之前没告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I didn't tell you before.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.68,1:35:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心你会对家庭生活感到失落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared you'd be disappointed with domestic life.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.32,1:36:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我这辈子做过的最棒决定就是走进那家杂货店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the best decision I ever made was stepping into the store.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.00,1:36:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后买了那第一块三明治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and buying that first sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.96,1:36:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那三明治可真是难吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was such a bad sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.44,1:36:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但我还是吃了好多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right? But I ate a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.04,1:36:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 米娅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.60,1:36:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.88,1:36:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.16,1:36:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说爱我的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you said it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.32,1:36:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是诀别 说点别的什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like goodbye. Say something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.88,1:36:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 替我吻杰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Kiss Jack for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.08,1:36:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.92,1:36:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 布莱恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.16,1:36:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 米娅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.40,1:37:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.36,1:38:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启天眼系统 找到他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boot up God's Eye. Find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.28,1:38:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting something.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.40,1:38:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了其中一个 是托莱多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a positive ID. It's Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.52,1:39:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼系统显示他在第七街和希尔街交界处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's Eye is placing him at Hill and Seventh.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.76,1:39:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要跟着他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we follow him?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.12,1:39:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 让肖对付他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Let Shaw take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.16,1:39:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,找拉姆齐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.28,1:39:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.12,1:39:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白为什么我们要这么一直这么开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why we gotta keep driving around like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.60,1:39:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么不能直接找个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't we just pull over somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.28,1:39:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,像堡垒之类的 然后就缩在里面不出来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}park, gather our thoughts in, like, a bunker somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.00,1:39:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这样是行不通的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it does not work like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.92,1:39:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要离那些坏人足够近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta stick close enough to the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.72,1:39:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让拉姆齐黑进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to get in range for Ramsey to hack them.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.92,1:39:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们又要离那些人足够远 不让他们把我们当靶子打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we gotta be mobile enough not to get shot like fish in a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.84,1:39:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就帮帮忙 专注点开车 别把我们都害死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do me a favor, focus on the mission and keep us from getting killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.52,1:39:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她了 目标锁定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got her. Target acquired.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.40,1:39:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她坐在一辆蓝色GT-R的副驾驶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's riding shotgun in a blue GT-R.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.60,1:39:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 他们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, they're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.12,1:39:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少辆车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many cars?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.20,1:39:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.44,1:39:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是问题的关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's kind of the problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.16,1:40:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 牵着他们鼻子走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's give them the tour.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.04,1:40:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我口令分开走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break on my mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.24,1:40:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.44,1:40:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.44,1:40:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,分开走也是没用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splitting up won't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.96,1:40:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们躲不过天眼系统的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't hide from God's Eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.60,1:40:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进入有效范围了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in range.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.92,1:40:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 开始黑他们的系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, start the hack.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.52,1:40:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiating.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.76,1:40:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.12,1:40:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我发觉有人正在黑进我们的系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I think someone's trying to hack the system.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.04,1:40:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是拉姆齐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.36,1:40:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出捕食者无人机！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send in the Predator!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.72,1:40:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her out!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.08,1:40:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出捕食者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Releasing Predator.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.44,1:41:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们好像甩掉直升机了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we lost the chopper.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.68,1:41:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们面临比直升机更大的问题！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got bigger problems than that!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.60,1:41:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.08,1:41:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.24,1:41:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用老办法！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going old school!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.92,1:41:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.44,1:42:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它又绕回来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming back around!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.40,1:43:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,捕食者重新锁定他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Predator's back on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.84,1:43:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备导弹！- 遵命 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready missiles! - Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.44,1:43:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.76,1:43:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.56,1:43:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被盯上了！我要把人换到你那里去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Football's hot! I need to lateral!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.16,1:43:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 你在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rom, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.44,1:43:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,正全速朝你那边赶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running back charging in!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.36,1:43:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在第三街和斯布林街碰头 - 没问题！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meet me on Third and Spring. - You got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.88,1:43:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成一半了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.20,1:43:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着你的电脑！从窗户出去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your computer! Get in the window!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.48,1:43:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 照做！快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Do it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.00,1:44:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得走了！就现在！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta go! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.76,1:44:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.72,1:44:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.60,1:44:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,命中了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.44,1:44:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃脱了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made it!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.80,1:44:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我们连这都做到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe we pulled that off.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.84,1:44:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 我们的系统还在被攻击 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, wait. We're still being hacked. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.84,1:44:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼系统还能追踪到拉姆齐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's Eye is still tracking Ramsey.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.76,1:45:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续让无人机追踪她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the drone in pursuit of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.32,1:45:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号肯定是从某个地方传出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal has to be coming from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.04,1:45:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新开球 闪电进攻 被94号拦截！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to throw. Here comes the blitz. Number 94 sacks him!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.80,1:45:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶晚间突发新闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaking news out of Los Angeles tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.24,1:45:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只能说是一场汽车大战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what can only be described as vehicular warfare,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.24,1:45:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察被卷入了一场高速追逐…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}police are engaged in a high-speed pursuit…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.96,1:45:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了他们是利用那边那个卫星信号塔黑进来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. They're piggybacking the hack off that satellite tower right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.04,1:45:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸了它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.20,1:46:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,托莱多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.48,1:46:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 怎么回事？我们差点就成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What happened? We were almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.80,1:46:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把信号切断了！我不能继续入侵了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've cut the signal! I can't finish the hack!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.88,1:46:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.84,1:46:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 他们炸掉了信号塔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, they took out the tower!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.32,1:46:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.04,1:46:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸要去工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's gotta go to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.72,1:46:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 宝贝女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.96,1:46:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莲娜马上就会到这里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elena's gonna be here in a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.84,1:47:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,老规矩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know our drill.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.16,1:47:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对拳三下 祝我好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me three for the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.20,1:47:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我是来街头斗殴的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought this was gonna be a street fight?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.92,1:47:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这就是街头斗殴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're goddamn right it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.16,1:48:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定还有其它办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.28,1:48:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我看到六座信号塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I'm seeing half a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.76,1:48:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在第六街和州立街之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cell towers between Sixth and State.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.96,1:48:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 如果你能爬到其中任何一栋大楼顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, if you can get to the top of any one of those buildings around there,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.92,1:48:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能手动的重新连接上信号 然后完成任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can reroute the signal manually and finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.20,1:48:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.52,1:48:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.72,1:48:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥康纳在徒步行动 目标是中继器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'Conner is on foot, heading for a repeater.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.80,1:48:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要重新启动无线入侵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to try to reinitiate the hack.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.32,1:48:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制无人机盯住那个女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the drone on the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.84,1:48:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,基特 奥康纳在第六街和州立街附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiet, O'Conner's on foot somewhere between Sixth and State.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.36,1:48:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他到达转接塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him make it there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.96,1:49:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,条子在追我们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them boys is on us!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.04,1:49:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 他们根本不知道是怎么回事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, them boys ain't ready for this!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.60,1:49:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.32,1:49:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是坦克 再来飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First the tank, then the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.36,1:49:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在换宇宙飞船了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we got a spaceship?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.68,1:49:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别瞎说 那是无人机！- 噢 无人机？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not a spaceship, that's a drone! - Oh, it's a drone?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.00,1:49:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种情势下 你还要慢条斯理地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you gonna break it down and be articulate.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.92,1:49:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我详细讲解是怎么回事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you already know what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.88,1:49:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 好好开车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your ass up and drive the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.24,1:49:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂 我们撑不住了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, the football's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.08,1:49:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求支援！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need help!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.76,1:49:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持下！我来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.40,1:50:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 准备好再次跳车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, get ready to go again!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.80,1:50:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无人机导弹锁定 - 发射！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drone has missile lock. - Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.56,1:50:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标摧毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.08,1:50:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我检查下是否还有信号 如果我可以重新连上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if we have a connection. If I can get back in…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.92,1:50:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等！天眼还能追踪到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait! God's Eye still has her.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.20,1:51:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.96,1:51:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.84,1:51:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车！快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.84,1:51:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在桥下让她换车了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They switched her under the bridge. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.08,1:51:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快离开 无人机正向你飞去 速度很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta get out of here. It's on your trail and it's coming fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.68,1:51:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.76,1:51:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这辆车也被毁 谁来救我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if this car goes down, who's coming to save us?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.52,1:51:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我们？这是最后一辆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save us, honey? We're it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.84,1:51:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.96,1:51:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,东边过六个街区 开溜中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six blocks east, hauling ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.60,1:51:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么走 特吉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we headed, Tej?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.88,1:51:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了维修区就有服务电梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a service elevator past the maintenance sector.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.16,1:51:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它直通中继器楼层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take you directly up to the repeater.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.36,1:51:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 动作要快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, you gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.64,1:53:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,太慢了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.40,1:54:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它绕回来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.48,1:54:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进隧道 甩掉它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll lose them in the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.92,1:54:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已瞄准 - 开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it. - Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.20,1:54:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本甩不掉它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't shake this thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.80,1:54:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,掠夺者导弹已锁定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Predator has missile lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.76,1:54:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.40,1:55:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.88,1:55:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！又怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.64,1:55:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 有人摧毁了无人机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, someone just double-tapped our drone.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.12,1:55:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.24,1:55:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 带上装甲部队了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you bring the cavalry?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.68,1:55:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 我即装甲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woman, I am the cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.16,1:55:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.48,1:55:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.88,1:55:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫霍布斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Hobbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.96,1:55:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到中继器面前了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at the repeater.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.16,1:55:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,接入电缆在底部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The access cable's in the base.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.80,1:55:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,将电缆插入你的手机 拉姆齐就能连上无线了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just plug it into your phone and Ramsey will be back online.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.36,1:55:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 可以了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.72,1:55:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩成功了 连接恢复！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian did it. We're back in!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.76,1:56:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们夺回天眼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got God's Eye back.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.68,1:56:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了天眼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost the God's Eye!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.92,1:56:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.28,1:56:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军来了 距我们三分钟并不断接近中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military's inbound. Three minutes and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.84,1:56:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须马上离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.44,1:56:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,特吉 罗曼 我去集合点了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej, Roman, I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.52,1:56:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 兄弟 集合点见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, homie, I'll see you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.36,1:57:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到托莱多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have eyes on Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.40,1:57:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火会伤到肖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shaw is in the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.72,1:57:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们的友情到此结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it seems our friendship is at an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.92,1:57:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.76,1:58:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,两者街斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing about street fights,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.76,1:58:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜者为「街」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the street always wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.68,1:58:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 托莱多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.88,1:58:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉它！干掉那个混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him out! Take down the bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.00,1:58:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这婊子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This son of a…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.68,1:59:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.68,1:59:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.24,1:59:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要支援！我们被火力压制！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some help over here! We're getting nailed!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.64,1:59:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要支援！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some backup!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.52,1:59:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！婊子养的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.32,1:59:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在逃跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.76,1:59:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！截住他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.04,2:00:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看准了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't miss.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.72,2:01:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.32,2:01:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.60,2:02:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有呼吸吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he breathing?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.80,2:02:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来托起他的头部 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to keep his head tilted up, all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.00,2:02:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样扶住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it back like this.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.56,2:02:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,捏住鼻子 保持头部翘起 对他进行人工呼吸 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinch his nose, keep his head tilted. Breathe into him, now. Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.00,2:02:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 撑住 唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Come on, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.60,2:02:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 唐 醒过来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dom. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.48,2:02:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的！给我醒过来！快呼吸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it! You come on! You breathe!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.44,2:02:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 继续！呼气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.92,2:02:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 该死的 醒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Damn it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.04,2:02:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 唐 快给我呼吸 快！撑住 唐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dom, I need you to breathe. Come on! Come on, Dom!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.92,2:02:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒过来！快 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back! Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.40,2:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下吧 - 唐 撑住！撑住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it. - Dom, come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.80,2:02:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.88,2:02:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样！继续人工呼吸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stop? Breathe into him.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.28,2:02:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开他！- 你继续人工呼吸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off of him! - You breathe into him!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.32,2:02:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后！- 你继续人工呼吸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back off! - You breathe into him!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.08,2:02:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.56,2:02:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.84,2:02:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.28,2:02:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 亲爱的 我知道你现在很痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, baby. I know you're hurting right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.64,2:02:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要听我说 保持清醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want you to listen. Stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.28,2:02:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把注意力集中在我身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and focus on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.52,2:02:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全都想起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.84,2:02:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们像洪水一样向我袭来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came to me like a flood.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.00,2:03:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得在多米尼加共和国的那一晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that night in the Dominican Republic.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.64,2:03:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚我们结婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night we got married.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.60,2:03:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.80,2:03:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will this do?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.96,2:03:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间将永远停在这一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have eternity in this moment.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.08,2:03:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也不会独自一人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never be alone again.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.80,2:03:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 你去哪 我就去哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I vow wherever you go, I go.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.48,2:03:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若飙车 我也飙车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ride, I ride.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.08,2:03:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打架 我也打架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight, I fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.00,2:03:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你死在我面前 多米尼克·托莱多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you ever die on me, Dominic Toretto,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.88,2:03:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也随你而去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna die with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.16,2:03:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 莱蒂 我会永远爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Letty. I will always love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.08,2:03:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了 我也不会独活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you die, I die.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.52,2:03:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没准备好离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not ready to leave this place yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.68,2:03:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,此刻我们依然拥有彼此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This moment is still ours.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.52,2:04:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.36,2:04:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切我都记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember it all.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.04,2:04:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.84,2:04:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经结婚的事 为什么不告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me we were married?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.60,2:04:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不能告诉一个人 她爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you can't tell someone they love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.00,2:04:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.16,2:05:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定带够人了吗 霍布斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you brought enough backup with you, Hobbs?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.80,2:05:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可不是为了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they ain't mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.28,2:05:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是为了保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.84,2:05:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免被我弄死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from me killing your ass.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.00,2:05:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这监狱关不住我 你知道的吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know none of this will keep me, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.00,2:05:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵 等你挖通38英尺的钢筋混凝土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, once you dig through 38 feet of concrete and steel,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.12,2:05:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带着尸体袋在另一边用拳头迎接你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my fist and a body bag will be waiting for you on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.64,2:06:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你现在就开始挖 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I suggest you get to digging, boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.52,2:06:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔呼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.92,2:06:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！快来玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy! Come play.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.72,2:06:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.84,2:06:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着他 走过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him. Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.20,2:06:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.88,2:06:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该尽责了 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Duty calls. - It does.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.44,2:06:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝 快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, babe, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.08,2:06:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,到妈妈那去 耶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get Mama. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.12,2:06:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.20,2:06:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳刚落下 我也好像三分熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the sun is out, I'm kind of medium rare,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.72,2:07:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以干得很好 我是说相当黑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can get, like, well done. Like, really dark.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.88,2:07:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你推我干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you nudging me for?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.96,2:07:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴两秒钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your mouth for two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.20,2:07:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那儿 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just open your eyes, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.92,2:07:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.72,2:07:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他属于那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.24,2:07:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.40,2:07:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远的归属{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where he's always belonged.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.24,2:07:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一切都变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are gonna be different now.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.00,2:07:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.56,2:07:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说再见就走了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't going to say goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.92,2:08:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不说再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.16,2:09:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 不说声再见就想逃吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You thought you could leave without saying goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.28,2:09:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾说我的生活就是一个个四分之一英里加速赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to say I live my life a quarter-mile at a time.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.20,2:09:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟之谊 便始于此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think that's why we were brothers.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.72,2:09:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你也这么生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you did, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.48,2:09:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你的车 - 我的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is your car. - My car?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.68,2:09:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,官方的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's official.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.72,2:09:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全自由了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all free.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.04,2:09:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是甜蜜的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.92,2:10:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 近来怎样？- 多谢邀请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening, dude? - Thanks for the invite.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.72,2:10:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车兜兜风？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna go for a drive?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.92,2:10:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论你身在何处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter where you are,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.60,2:10:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是四分之一英里之外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether it's a quarter-mile away.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.92,2:10:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是相隔半个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or halfway across the world,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.48,2:10:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命中最重要的就是珍惜相伴在屋檐下的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most important thing in life will always be the people in this room.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.40,2:10:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,此处 此刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.92,2:10:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为家人健康干杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salud mi familia.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.40,2:10:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salud.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.92,2:10:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远相伴左右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll always be with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.80,2:10:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟之谊长存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll always be my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,手榴弹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:51.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国 伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:33.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（外交安全局 洛杉矶分部）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.64,0:46:46.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿塞拜疆 高加索山脉）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.86,1:15:33.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发现入侵者）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.76,1:15:34.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（关闭系统）
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.62,2:03:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带着结婚戒指吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.36,2:05:09.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中情局秘密关押处）
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.86,2:11:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[献给保罗]
